{"source": "01.mp4", "duration": 1099.1789375, "segments": [{"id": "line-1", "start": 5.65, "end": 8.39, "text": "辯方律師, 你可以開設結案層次了"}, {"id": "line-2", "start": 11.49, "end": 15.68, "text": "法官大人, 聽過控辯雙方 這麼多證人作供之後"}, {"id": "line-3", "start": 15.68, "end": 17.44, "text": "其實不難得到一個結論"}, {"id": "line-4", "start": 18.04, "end": 21.56, "text": "就是對我當時人作出非禮的指控 簡直就是荒謬"}, {"id": "line-5", "start": 22.16, "end": 23.62, "text": "大家看看我當時人"}, {"id": "line-6", "start": 23.62, "end": 27.88, "text": "他身高六赤一全高 年輕有為, 事業有成"}, {"id": "line-7", "start": 27.88, "end": 29.98, "text": "而且一年身一百五十萬"}, {"id": "line-8", "start": 30.44, "end": 33.38, "text": "他為人風流蜜糖, 風趣幽默"}, {"id": "line-9", "start": 33.76, "end": 37.08, "text": "在他身邊都不知道 多養靚身材好的異性"}, {"id": "line-10", "start": 37.08, "end": 40.1, "text": "等著我和她去街,她怎麼會非禮人呢?"}, {"id": "line-11", "start": 40.16, "end": 43.54, "text": "這些好條件的男人,簡直是世上罕有"}, {"id": "line-12", "start": 44.08, "end": 46.04, "text": "連我好條件的女人也有點心動"}, {"id": "line-13", "start": 50.66, "end": 51.02, "text": "對不起"}, {"id": "line-14", "start": 52.66, "end": 55.32, "text": "我翻查過我當時人的戀愛紀錄"}, {"id": "line-15", "start": 55.7, "end": 58.38, "text": "從來只有她非人,沒有女人非過她"}, {"id": "line-16", "start": 58.8, "end": 60.8, "text": "我當時人對異性的吸引力"}, {"id": "line-17", "start": 60.8, "end": 62.4, "text": "簡直就是爆棚了"}, {"id": "line-18", "start": 62.4, "end": 65.22, "text": "所以她一定不會是一個鹹濕佬"}, {"id": "line-19", "start": 65.22, "end": 68.42, "text": "因為我也是一個有專業操守的律師"}, {"id": "line-20", "start": 68.42, "end": 70.76, "text": "我一定不會和鹹濕佬打官司"}, {"id": "line-21", "start": 71.34, "end": 74.92, "text": "所以我肯請法官判我當時無罪釋放"}, {"id": "line-22", "start": 87.15, "end": 88.71, "text": "冷靜點…"}, {"id": "line-23", "start": 92.29, "end": 94.49, "text": "對不起,我發夢了,不好意思"}, {"id": "line-24", "start": 94.97, "end": 96.51, "text": "飛機就去過龍香港了"}, {"id": "line-25", "start": 96.51, "end": 97.99, "text": "麻煩你求安全帶先"}, {"id": "line-26", "start": 97.99, "end": 98.39, "text": "好"}, {"id": "line-27", "start": 101.93, "end": 103.15, "text": "不如我幫你"}, {"id": "line-28", "start": 118.73, "end": 119.17, "text": "不好意思"}, {"id": "line-29", "start": 119.17, "end": 119.37, "text": "什麼意思?"}, {"id": "line-30", "start": 120.41, "end": 121.07, "text": "不要緊"}, {"id": "line-31", "start": 121.92, "end": 126.36, "text": "那你…你握住了一隻手"}, {"id": "line-32", "start": 127.84, "end": 128.26, "text": "對不起"}, {"id": "line-33", "start": 129.84, "end": 131.24, "text": "如果有什麼需要,就儘管找我"}, {"id": "line-34", "start": 131.24, "end": 132.06, "text": "這位太太"}, {"id": "line-35", "start": 134.6, "end": 136.84, "text": "什麼太太?我還沒結婚"}, {"id": "line-36", "start": 136.84, "end": 138.78, "text": "你什麼名字?我要求求你"}, {"id": "line-37", "start": 140.76, "end": 176.5, "text": "看路了,沒什麼"}, {"id": "line-38", "start": 187.58, "end": 190.64, "text": "拜託Andy,沒早?"}, {"id": "line-39", "start": 191.46, "end": 192.32, "text": "那Paul,拜託"}, {"id": "line-40", "start": 193.5, "end": 194.21, "text": "也沒早?"}, {"id": "line-41", "start": 195.0, "end": 196.74, "text": "這裡是不是CK律師樓?"}, {"id": "line-42", "start": 198.34, "end": 200.24, "text": "那你叫我秘書Apple聽電話"}, {"id": "line-43", "start": 204.72, "end": 205.66, "text": "你幫人家回來了?"}, {"id": "line-44", "start": 206.26, "end": 208.55, "text": "我?我昨天回來了"}, {"id": "line-45", "start": 209.05, "end": 210.72, "text": "師兒現在很混亂"}, {"id": "line-46", "start": 210.72, "end": 212.02, "text": "你為何不偷偷的才回來"}, {"id": "line-47", "start": 213.4, "end": 216.0, "text": "我免得是假期給公司"}, {"id": "line-48", "start": 216.0, "end": 217.4, "text": "你怎麼會那麼吵"}, {"id": "line-49", "start": 218.28, "end": 220.28, "text": "是呀,現在大地震"}, {"id": "line-50", "start": 220.8, "end": 224.08, "text": "甚麼?甚麼地震?香港有地震嗎"}, {"id": "line-51", "start": 224.08, "end": 227.4, "text": "不是,我是說公司現在大地震"}, {"id": "line-52", "start": 228.1, "end": 228.58, "text": "哪裡?"}, {"id": "line-53", "start": 234.42, "end": 236.28, "text": "不好意思,你那裡很吵"}, {"id": "line-54", "start": 236.28, "end": 237.4, "text": "我聽不到你說甚麼"}, {"id": "line-55", "start": 237.4, "end": 239.4, "text": "有什麼回公司說, 我就來到了"}, {"id": "line-56", "start": 239.86, "end": 240.78, "text": "就這樣吧"}, {"id": "line-57", "start": 264.27, "end": 265.13, "text": "按了"}, {"id": "line-58", "start": 265.13, "end": 270.85, "text": "這裡是十七, 新來的"}, {"id": "line-59", "start": 272.53, "end": 290.21, "text": "歡迎光臨, 小姐"}, {"id": "line-60", "start": 290.67, "end": 291.99, "text": "這裡不是十七樓嗎?"}, {"id": "line-61", "start": 292.05, "end": 292.61, "text": "對, 沒錯"}, {"id": "line-62", "start": 292.61, "end": 294.77, "text": "你已經完全正確地踏進"}, {"id": "line-63", "start": 294.77, "end": 296.81, "text": "我們十七樓的健康大門, 小姐"}, {"id": "line-64", "start": 296.81, "end": 298.43, "text": "慢著, CK律師樓呢?"}, {"id": "line-65", "start": 298.67, "end": 301.29, "text": "CK律師樓?做不住了, 搬到下一層"}, {"id": "line-66", "start": 301.65, "end": 304.43, "text": "現在是我們健身院的世界, 小姐"}, {"id": "line-67", "start": 304.95, "end": 305.61, "text": "不是吧?"}, {"id": "line-68", "start": 306.23, "end": 307.99, "text": "小姐, 我們歡迎女婚入會"}, {"id": "line-69", "start": 307.99, "end": 309.03, "text": "行了, 不用了"}, {"id": "line-70", "start": 309.67, "end": 311.59, "text": "小姐…我們很多明星在玩"}, {"id": "line-71", "start": 323.22, "end": 324.86, "text": "不好意思, 我的律師在裝修"}, {"id": "line-72", "start": 324.86, "end": 326.24, "text": "請問你有沒有辦公室"}, {"id": "line-73", "start": 326.68, "end": 328.42, "text": "你哪位?Rebecca呢?"}, {"id": "line-74", "start": 328.44, "end": 330.0, "text": "Rebecca?我不知道誰是Rebecca"}, {"id": "line-75", "start": 330.0, "end": 331.46, "text": "我剛才還沒來過"}, {"id": "line-76", "start": 331.46, "end": 333.36, "text": "行了, 我也在這裡上班"}, {"id": "line-77", "start": 333.36, "end": 334.54, "text": "我自己照顧自己"}, {"id": "line-78", "start": 334.54, "end": 335.92, "text": "我原來是同事, 怎麼稱呼?"}, {"id": "line-79", "start": 336.18, "end": 336.58, "text": "Miss Mo"}, {"id": "line-80", "start": 336.58, "end": 337.68, "text": "Miss Mo, 我叫Sandy"}, {"id": "line-81", "start": 338.4, "end": 340.97, "text": "Sandy, 搞什麼?"}, {"id": "line-82", "start": 360.87, "end": 362.61, "text": "看事完蛋了"}, {"id": "line-83", "start": 362.61, "end": 364.83, "text": "這個世界怎麼走濕路?"}, {"id": "line-84", "start": 365.67, "end": 366.33, "text": "你說什麼?"}, {"id": "line-85", "start": 366.33, "end": 368.57, "text": "阿嬸, 是否不值得沒有人來找你"}, {"id": "line-86", "start": 369.61, "end": 371.87, "text": "你叫我甚麼?我高你來匪訪"}, {"id": "line-87", "start": 371.87, "end": 375.15, "text": "高我們匪訪?你自己知道自己的事"}, {"id": "line-88", "start": 375.97, "end": 377.91, "text": "是兄弟的, 接近了他"}, {"id": "line-89", "start": 377.91, "end": 379.83, "text": "不是, 這麼老, 你驅瘋"}, {"id": "line-90", "start": 379.83, "end": 381.17, "text": "你幹甚麼? 幹甚麼"}, {"id": "line-91", "start": 381.17, "end": 383.03, "text": "不行, 我知道你在這裡工作"}, {"id": "line-92", "start": 383.69, "end": 385.33, "text": "我都知道你在哪裡工作"}, {"id": "line-93", "start": 386.87, "end": 389.73, "text": "很可愛的弟弟, 害怕了吧"}, {"id": "line-94", "start": 389.73, "end": 390.53, "text": "害怕他工作"}, {"id": "line-95", "start": 391.81, "end": 393.75, "text": "打壞年輕人, 罵不行"}, {"id": "line-96", "start": 393.75, "end": 395.23, "text": "Mismo, 回來了"}, {"id": "line-97", "start": 396.09, "end": 397.71, "text": "還要見見吃的東西"}, {"id": "line-98", "start": 397.71, "end": 399.49, "text": "Apple才會搞什麼?這裡"}, {"id": "line-99", "start": 399.49, "end": 402.79, "text": "怎麼會上來你這麼長一步"}, {"id": "line-100", "start": 402.79, "end": 403.69, "text": "你有沒有辦公室?"}, {"id": "line-101", "start": 404.41, "end": 405.63, "text": "你的辦公室在那邊"}, {"id": "line-102", "start": 408.32, "end": 410.28, "text": "這個吧, 這個是你的辦公室"}, {"id": "line-103", "start": 415.79, "end": 417.89, "text": "嚴格來說, 這裡是豆腐瓶"}, {"id": "line-104", "start": 418.47, "end": 419.83, "text": "我以前的辦公室在這裡"}, {"id": "line-105", "start": 419.83, "end": 422.13, "text": "三倍的, 有個無敵海景"}, {"id": "line-106", "start": 422.94, "end": 425.4, "text": "我不管, 我要在這裡開窗"}, {"id": "line-107", "start": 425.4, "end": 426.56, "text": "這裡… 後面廁所"}, {"id": "line-108", "start": 427.92, "end": 430.18, "text": "這裡, 這裡是電梯行動"}, {"id": "line-109", "start": 430.95, "end": 432.03, "text": "那這裡呢?這裡"}, {"id": "line-110", "start": 432.53, "end": 433.67, "text": "這裡當然不行"}, {"id": "line-111", "start": 434.49, "end": 435.61, "text": "James, 為什麼?"}, {"id": "line-112", "start": 436.05, "end": 436.91, "text": "賣辦公室"}, {"id": "line-113", "start": 437.79, "end": 440.13, "text": "你別再用我回來, 給我一點刺激"}, {"id": "line-114", "start": 440.13, "end": 442.93, "text": "我不是刺激你, 你過來…"}, {"id": "line-115", "start": 442.99, "end": 445.17, "text": "你還是試試鄭鄭這個四方形"}, {"id": "line-116", "start": 445.61, "end": 447.39, "text": "你見過三千八個辦公室嗎?"}, {"id": "line-117", "start": 448.51, "end": 449.61, "text": "我才剛剛適應"}, {"id": "line-118", "start": 450.87, "end": 452.41, "text": "這司機搞什麼?"}, {"id": "line-119", "start": 452.59, "end": 454.61, "text": "弄個這樣的辦公室給我們探討"}, {"id": "line-120", "start": 454.61, "end": 456.99, "text": "有事一件事就說出來"}, {"id": "line-121", "start": 456.99, "end": 458.49, "text": "一筆筆那麼長"}, {"id": "line-122", "start": 459.77, "end": 461.41, "text": "對, 怕死我了"}, {"id": "line-123", "start": 463.27, "end": 465.43, "text": "糟糕了, 全都倒閉了"}, {"id": "line-124", "start": 465.43, "end": 467.25, "text": "我都說女人家不要吵吵"}, {"id": "line-125", "start": 467.91, "end": 469.47, "text": "這次你要很難洗的"}, {"id": "line-126", "start": 469.47, "end": 470.69, "text": "快進廁所洗乾淨去"}, {"id": "line-127", "start": 470.69, "end": 473.29, "text": "大嵐, 大嵐, 別碰"}, {"id": "line-128", "start": 475.95, "end": 494.32, "text": "小姐, 這件事沒事了"}, {"id": "line-129", "start": 494.32, "end": 496.56, "text": "一場誤會, 好嗎?"}, {"id": "line-130", "start": 496.6, "end": 498.44, "text": "世奇, 哄一巴掌好小事"}, {"id": "line-131", "start": 498.44, "end": 499.46, "text": "問題是我被人哄"}, {"id": "line-132", "start": 499.46, "end": 500.82, "text": "現在好像不適合的是我"}, {"id": "line-133", "start": 500.82, "end": 502.42, "text": "我這樣, 那我比較虛假"}, {"id": "line-134", "start": 502.42, "end": 505.2, "text": "男人老舅舅是男廁, 對吧?"}, {"id": "line-135", "start": 505.3, "end": 507.12, "text": "而且他沒有女廁"}, {"id": "line-136", "start": 507.7, "end": 510.4, "text": "CK, 我今天第一天回到新辦公室"}, {"id": "line-137", "start": 510.4, "end": 512.2, "text": "我怎麼知道這場樓男廁是女廁?"}, {"id": "line-138", "start": 512.92, "end": 515.68, "text": "那倒是, 這麼久不回來"}, {"id": "line-139", "start": 515.68, "end": 517.58, "text": "進錯了也不出奇"}, {"id": "line-140", "start": 517.58, "end": 520.02, "text": "簡直是我錯了, 我用盡力"}, {"id": "line-141", "start": 520.02, "end": 521.66, "text": "把臉蓋在她的手掌上"}, {"id": "line-142", "start": 522.48, "end": 524.4, "text": "那你就創手一點"}, {"id": "line-143", "start": 524.88, "end": 525.98, "text": "你看到有個男人"}, {"id": "line-144", "start": 525.98, "end": 527.26, "text": "休息一下, 休息一下"}, {"id": "line-145", "start": 527.26, "end": 528.72, "text": "褲子哭了, 你不怕嗎?"}, {"id": "line-146", "start": 528.72, "end": 529.72, "text": "這樣也有問題"}, {"id": "line-147", "start": 531.3, "end": 533.58, "text": "一個男人在男廁休闊"}, {"id": "line-148", "start": 534.36, "end": 535.68, "text": "這樣也很正常"}, {"id": "line-149", "start": 536.64, "end": 537.88, "text": "有個女人站在這裡"}, {"id": "line-150", "start": 538.5, "end": 540.18, "text": "那你要看真實的"}, {"id": "line-151", "start": 541.05, "end": 543.27, "text": "不用說話了, 總之說到尾"}, {"id": "line-152", "start": 543.27, "end": 544.65, "text": "我不對, 我不穿"}, {"id": "line-153", "start": 545.81, "end": 547.61, "text": "我這人很均衡, 行"}, {"id": "line-154", "start": 547.61, "end": 548.93, "text": "我入錯男廁"}, {"id": "line-155", "start": 548.93, "end": 551.15, "text": "我對不起, 好嗎?"}, {"id": "line-156", "start": 569.7, "end": 571.52, "text": "對不起, 好嗎?"}, {"id": "line-157", "start": 572.59, "end": 575.03, "text": "好了…大家沒事了"}, {"id": "line-158", "start": 575.03, "end": 577.92, "text": "對了, Miss Mo 夠了大量了"}, {"id": "line-159", "start": 579.52, "end": 581.1, "text": "你跟你們正式介紹過"}, {"id": "line-160", "start": 581.86, "end": 583.9, "text": "娛樂天, 新來的師爺"}, {"id": "line-161", "start": 583.9, "end": 586.38, "text": "Miss Mo, 這裡的職責"}, {"id": "line-162", "start": 586.74, "end": 587.48, "text": "九人…"}, {"id": "line-163", "start": 588.18, "end": 591.08, "text": "以後我會預訂娛樂天跟你們工作"}, {"id": "line-164", "start": 591.62, "end": 592.52, "text": "大家合作愉快"}, {"id": "line-165", "start": 594.0, "end": 596.52, "text": "她是先職的表達, 先職介紹來的"}, {"id": "line-166", "start": 596.52, "end": 598.44, "text": "很做得來的, 你放心吧"}, {"id": "line-167", "start": 598.44, "end": 600.36, "text": "妹子, 以前我和兩個師爺"}, {"id": "line-168", "start": 600.36, "end": 601.94, "text": "Andy和阿波呢?"}, {"id": "line-169", "start": 602.9, "end": 603.52, "text": "解僱了"}, {"id": "line-170", "start": 605.24, "end": 605.6, "text": "為什麼?"}, {"id": "line-171", "start": 605.6, "end": 605.66, "text": "為什麼?"}, {"id": "line-172", "start": 606.2, "end": 609.52, "text": "人工貴, 市道不好, 什麼都說是增值"}, {"id": "line-173", "start": 609.52, "end": 611.04, "text": "當然是請這一個頂得多"}, {"id": "line-174", "start": 612.57, "end": 613.81, "text": "還有我的辦公室"}, {"id": "line-175", "start": 614.25, "end": 615.39, "text": "小時候就像豆腐潤一樣"}, {"id": "line-176", "start": 615.39, "end": 616.65, "text": "四面都是長的, 怎麼辦?"}, {"id": "line-177", "start": 617.21, "end": 619.29, "text": "金融風暴後為正, Miss Mo"}, {"id": "line-178", "start": 619.29, "end": 621.31, "text": "七千呎, 官落千七呎"}, {"id": "line-179", "start": 621.31, "end": 622.17, "text": "我哪個都不想"}, {"id": "line-180", "start": 622.83, "end": 624.39, "text": "你告了價那兩個月"}, {"id": "line-181", "start": 624.39, "end": 626.91, "text": "不是CK實力紅口都頂不到金人"}, {"id": "line-182", "start": 626.91, "end": 629.21, "text": "我現在在問CK, 我不是在問你"}, {"id": "line-183", "start": 629.83, "end": 633.61, "text": "我只是幫CK回答, 人家好像…"}, {"id": "line-184", "start": 633.61, "end": 634.95, "text": "媽媽出殯, 你又不停問"}, {"id": "line-185", "start": 634.95, "end": 637.19, "text": "那他怎麼死的?有沒有抽筋?"}, {"id": "line-186", "start": 637.47, "end": 638.81, "text": "有沒有死得很辛苦?有沒有噴血?"}, {"id": "line-187", "start": 638.93, "end": 639.51, "text": "怎麼回答?"}, {"id": "line-188", "start": 639.63, "end": 641.33, "text": "剛才那一包我寫了對不起"}, {"id": "line-189", "start": 641.83, "end": 643.51, "text": "有沒有工作?先出去吧,好嗎?"}, {"id": "line-190", "start": 643.65, "end": 644.55, "text": "我有事要跟司機說"}, {"id": "line-191", "start": 644.95, "end": 655.21, "text": "先出去,阿樂,不要勞氣"}, {"id": "line-192", "start": 655.21, "end": 656.15, "text": "我不勞氣"}, {"id": "line-193", "start": 656.15, "end": 658.11, "text": "先喝一杯咖啡吧 我不喝咖啡"}, {"id": "line-194", "start": 658.11, "end": 659.33, "text": "司機,你是不是弄我?"}, {"id": "line-195", "start": 659.57, "end": 661.59, "text": "你看那傢伙的樣子,你看他的頭髮"}, {"id": "line-196", "start": 661.59, "end": 663.15, "text": "我怕那些客人以為"}, {"id": "line-197", "start": 663.15, "end": 664.55, "text": "古惑仔入侵我們律師樓"}, {"id": "line-198", "start": 665.07, "end": 666.37, "text": "他做得很棒"}, {"id": "line-199", "start": 666.89, "end": 668.99, "text": "剛才他所說的一切就解釋了"}, {"id": "line-200", "start": 668.99, "end": 671.73, "text": "是呀, 現在槍就下了, 什麼時勢"}, {"id": "line-201", "start": 673.29, "end": 675.19, "text": "什麼事都搞, 跟我搞完一宗案件"}, {"id": "line-202", "start": 675.19, "end": 676.27, "text": "是樓梯"}, {"id": "line-203", "start": 676.69, "end": 679.49, "text": "樓梯?現在才叫樓梯做"}, {"id": "line-204", "start": 679.49, "end": 681.57, "text": "那男DJ喜歡做女人三個Ricky"}, {"id": "line-205", "start": 682.23, "end": 684.27, "text": "現在跟那個闊太董小姐分手"}, {"id": "line-206", "start": 684.79, "end": 687.25, "text": "找我們做代表接收私人物品"}, {"id": "line-207", "start": 687.9, "end": 689.08, "text": "幫忙吧"}, {"id": "line-208", "start": 689.52, "end": 691.08, "text": "那個DJ真是口臭"}, {"id": "line-209", "start": 691.08, "end": 693.78, "text": "我們幹嘛接近濕碎案件"}, {"id": "line-210", "start": 693.78, "end": 695.78, "text": "知道他濕碎還是口臭"}, {"id": "line-211", "start": 695.78, "end": 697.92, "text": "有這些案件做影就好了"}, {"id": "line-212", "start": 697.92, "end": 700.9, "text": "好, 說不定將來我們做得這些案件好"}, {"id": "line-213", "start": 701.44, "end": 704.72, "text": "大凡明星和一副膽子, 分手了"}, {"id": "line-214", "start": 704.72, "end": 705.7, "text": "幫忙我們"}, {"id": "line-215", "start": 706.54, "end": 710.38, "text": "司機我們是大行, 剛才還保存了"}, {"id": "line-216", "start": 710.86, "end": 714.76, "text": "告訴她, 現在大小通客也沒辦法"}, {"id": "line-217", "start": 715.6, "end": 721.93, "text": "Mismol, 其實你不用道歉"}, {"id": "line-218", "start": 722.41, "end": 723.19, "text": "是她不對"}, {"id": "line-219", "start": 724.25, "end": 725.69, "text": "不, 我也不對"}, {"id": "line-220", "start": 725.69, "end": 726.81, "text": "不太有問題"}, {"id": "line-221", "start": 726.81, "end": 729.87, "text": "是, 這個是我自小的表達"}, {"id": "line-222", "start": 730.51, "end": 732.63, "text": "她有什麼做錯的?你即本罵她"}, {"id": "line-223", "start": 733.23, "end": 734.91, "text": "我做事公司分明你才知道"}, {"id": "line-224", "start": 735.51, "end": 737.59, "text": "這樣就好了,是黑衣仔"}, {"id": "line-225", "start": 737.59, "end": 740.77, "text": "從小刮到大,神神不來擔心"}, {"id": "line-226", "start": 741.17, "end": 743.13, "text": "最重要是你多多指教她"}, {"id": "line-227", "start": 743.67, "end": 746.29, "text": "先姐這樣說,下次我不留力了"}, {"id": "line-228", "start": 746.29, "end": 747.93, "text": "不要帶力,剛才就行了"}, {"id": "line-229", "start": 748.33, "end": 750.89, "text": "男人老狗,沒理由把這些放在心裡"}, {"id": "line-230", "start": 751.43, "end": 752.27, "text": "我… 你看"}, {"id": "line-231", "start": 752.93, "end": 755.17, "text": "打也沒反應,沒事的"}, {"id": "line-232", "start": 755.17, "end": 757.83, "text": "以後好一點,今天不要學了,知道嗎"}, {"id": "line-233", "start": 759.41, "end": 761.25, "text": "這些回頭你放在我的辦公室"}, {"id": "line-234", "start": 761.73, "end": 763.15, "text": "雖然是無謂的案件"}, {"id": "line-235", "start": 763.15, "end": 764.37, "text": "不過我們是專業的"}, {"id": "line-236", "start": 764.37, "end": 766.75, "text": "一定要做得很好看, 明白嗎?"}, {"id": "line-237", "start": 771.57, "end": 774.28, "text": "打打打就習慣了, 是不是?"}, {"id": "line-238", "start": 775.24, "end": 776.1, "text": "早安…"}, {"id": "line-239", "start": 776.1, "end": 778.58, "text": "我兩個月姐發生這麼多事"}, {"id": "line-240", "start": 778.58, "end": 779.88, "text": "你的電腦幫你設好"}, {"id": "line-241", "start": 779.88, "end": 781.92, "text": "好在今次阿Lok來幫我手"}, {"id": "line-242", "start": 781.92, "end": 783.3, "text": "你知道我對電腦對媽媽的"}, {"id": "line-243", "start": 784.3, "end": 786.22, "text": "Apple, 這些是甚麼?"}, {"id": "line-244", "start": 786.84, "end": 787.02, "text": "甚麼?"}, {"id": "line-245", "start": 791.24, "end": 793.46, "text": "你說那天Lok弄過我的電腦, 是嗎?"}, {"id": "line-246", "start": 793.7, "end": 794.7, "text": "開工了, Miss Mock"}, {"id": "line-247", "start": 795.98, "end": 797.58, "text": "怎麼樣?我驚喜了"}, {"id": "line-248", "start": 798.4, "end": 799.14, "text": "這是什麼?"}, {"id": "line-249", "start": 800.57, "end": 801.65, "text": "是不是劍皮開胃了?"}, {"id": "line-250", "start": 802.21, "end": 803.35, "text": "你有沒有看我笑?"}, {"id": "line-251", "start": 805.02, "end": 806.18, "text": "不是的"}, {"id": "line-252", "start": 806.18, "end": 808.18, "text": "我出了這個,應該是黑人"}, {"id": "line-253", "start": 808.6, "end": 809.24, "text": "Michael Jackson"}, {"id": "line-254", "start": 809.24, "end": 811.52, "text": "Michael Jackson還是黑人嗎?"}, {"id": "line-255", "start": 811.9, "end": 813.22, "text": "之前和之後吧"}, {"id": "line-256", "start": 813.63, "end": 816.09, "text": "什麼?真的是黑了?"}, {"id": "line-257", "start": 816.49, "end": 817.67, "text": "是不是你的線有問題?"}, {"id": "line-258", "start": 818.59, "end": 822.23, "text": "娛樂天,待會我們的客人上來了"}, {"id": "line-259", "start": 822.23, "end": 823.37, "text": "你坐到就行了"}, {"id": "line-260", "start": 823.37, "end": 825.43, "text": "什麼都不要碰,不要出聲,明白嗎?"}, {"id": "line-261", "start": 825.43, "end": 826.95, "text": "不是吧, 但要我跟開"}, {"id": "line-262", "start": 826.95, "end": 828.33, "text": "我跟會方便一點"}, {"id": "line-263", "start": 828.33, "end": 829.75, "text": "我不用你教嗎?"}, {"id": "line-264", "start": 829.83, "end": 830.53, "text": "不是這個意思"}, {"id": "line-265", "start": 830.53, "end": 832.37, "text": "但你做了一些扭氣大茶飯"}, {"id": "line-266", "start": 832.37, "end": 833.93, "text": "總之…"}, {"id": "line-267", "start": 834.65, "end": 837.71, "text": "一會兒你闖道, 就開口, 閉嘴"}, {"id": "line-268", "start": 837.71, "end": 839.49, "text": "英文閉嘴不是閉嘴嗎?"}, {"id": "line-269", "start": 840.7, "end": 842.38, "text": "你別再閉嘴了"}, {"id": "line-270", "start": 844.2, "end": 846.09, "text": "是, 好, 知道"}, {"id": "line-271", "start": 847.6, "end": 849.68, "text": "對方的律師現在上來了"}, {"id": "line-272", "start": 849.68, "end": 852.76, "text": "從這一刻開始, 開口"}, {"id": "line-273", "start": 854.84, "end": 856.28, "text": "有記者"}, {"id": "line-274", "start": 856.88, "end": 859.28, "text": "明星分手, 聽說袁爸爸頭痛"}, {"id": "line-275", "start": 859.28, "end": 861.32, "text": "很棒, 我的樣子不錯嗎?"}, {"id": "line-276", "start": 861.78, "end": 862.18, "text": "完美"}, {"id": "line-277", "start": 862.92, "end": 864.7, "text": "你先坐這邊 謝謝你"}, {"id": "line-278", "start": 866.78, "end": 868.34, "text": "你們兩個臭小子, 過當不橫"}, {"id": "line-279", "start": 868.34, "end": 869.78, "text": "我知道欠我的兩應不用還"}, {"id": "line-280", "start": 870.29, "end": 872.38, "text": "天哥… 天哥叫天仔"}, {"id": "line-281", "start": 872.38, "end": 873.28, "text": "賢樂天"}, {"id": "line-282", "start": 877.52, "end": 878.52, "text": "我們可以開始嗎?"}, {"id": "line-283", "start": 879.08, "end": 880.32, "text": "可以, 這邊 謝謝"}, {"id": "line-284", "start": 882.83, "end": 884.93, "text": "在我們的當事人Ricky Fung先生"}, {"id": "line-285", "start": 884.93, "end": 887.71, "text": "以及你的當事人董美琴小姐協議之下"}, {"id": "line-286", "start": 887.71, "end": 890.07, "text": "就是在交還所有私人物件之後"}, {"id": "line-287", "start": 890.07, "end": 892.17, "text": "就正式分手, 以後互不拖欠"}, {"id": "line-288", "start": 892.57, "end": 894.69, "text": "沒錯, 但我也會代表"}, {"id": "line-289", "start": 894.69, "end": 896.19, "text": "我當時不保留追究你"}, {"id": "line-290", "start": 896.19, "end": 897.45, "text": "當時是Mr. Ricky Fung"}, {"id": "line-291", "start": 897.45, "end": 900.01, "text": "誹謗董小姐法律責任的一件事"}, {"id": "line-292", "start": 900.01, "end": 901.01, "text": "一彈還一彈"}, {"id": "line-293", "start": 901.01, "end": 903.17, "text": "現在你們可以交還 Mr. Ricky Fung"}, {"id": "line-294", "start": 903.17, "end": 903.97, "text": "私人物件"}, {"id": "line-295", "start": 903.97, "end": 906.61, "text": "好, 但由於數目眾多"}, {"id": "line-296", "start": 906.61, "end": 909.97, "text": "我想先給你清單過目 好, 清清楚楚"}, {"id": "line-297", "start": 912.39, "end": 914.51, "text": "那怎麼辦?我… 不用了"}, {"id": "line-298", "start": 914.51, "end": 918.5, "text": "不是, 因為我… 是, 這麼多"}, {"id": "line-299", "start": 918.86, "end": 920.8, "text": "對了, 首先第一項"}, {"id": "line-300", "start": 921.38, "end": 923.94, "text": "三十六條男裝內褲, 請你點手"}, {"id": "line-301", "start": 923.94, "end": 929.45, "text": "來,吃一口"}, {"id": "line-302", "start": 929.45, "end": 931.12, "text": "菜色很嚴重"}, {"id": "line-303", "start": 931.12, "end": 931.64, "text": "螢光綠香"}, {"id": "line-304", "start": 931.64, "end": 932.6, "text": "洗光了"}, {"id": "line-305", "start": 932.6, "end": 935.64, "text": "應該是洗過了"}, {"id": "line-306", "start": 935.64, "end": 944.72, "text": "螢光綠一條"}, {"id": "line-307", "start": 948.36, "end": 950.46, "text": "螢光粉紅一條"}, {"id": "line-308", "start": 950.46, "end": 952.26, "text": "黑白間條一條"}, {"id": "line-309", "start": 952.26, "end": 953.96, "text": "深藍綠色三仔花"}, {"id": "line-310", "start": 955.03, "end": 970.43, "text": "藍藍Q三角的泡雲一條"}, {"id": "line-311", "start": 970.93, "end": 973.61, "text": "小鳥, 我來移個小小, 拜託"}, {"id": "line-312", "start": 973.61, "end": 975.09, "text": "謝謝…"}, {"id": "line-313", "start": 977.04, "end": 980.43, "text": "慢著…這條應該是泡紋"}, {"id": "line-314", "start": 980.89, "end": 982.23, "text": "你看那種邪文化"}, {"id": "line-315", "start": 982.23, "end": 983.61, "text": "應該是虎紋, 是不是?"}, {"id": "line-316", "start": 983.77, "end": 984.43, "text": "請你清清楚"}, {"id": "line-317", "start": 985.69, "end": 988.65, "text": "好, 有些問題, 先我們檢討一下"}, {"id": "line-318", "start": 990.52, "end": 991.86, "text": "好邪有一點點出油"}, {"id": "line-319", "start": 993.42, "end": 996.0, "text": "對, Brian, 應該是虎紋"}, {"id": "line-320", "start": 998.63, "end": 1000.13, "text": "好, 36條了, 是嗎?"}, {"id": "line-321", "start": 1000.47, "end": 1000.67, "text": "是"}, {"id": "line-322", "start": 1001.94, "end": 1002.6, "text": "沒事吧?"}, {"id": "line-323", "start": 1002.6, "end": 1005.62, "text": "還有…還有兩隻三級ECD"}, {"id": "line-324", "start": 1005.62, "end": 1008.92, "text": "三級ECD"}, {"id": "line-325", "start": 1009.44, "end": 1009.76, "text": "謝謝"}, {"id": "line-326", "start": 1010.54, "end": 1012.04, "text": "需要檢查一下內容嗎"}, {"id": "line-327", "start": 1012.04, "end": 1013.72, "text": "當然要,我們ECD律師樓"}, {"id": "line-328", "start": 1013.72, "end": 1014.66, "text": "非常專業"}, {"id": "line-329", "start": 1015.12, "end": 1017.46, "text": "麻煩你,先給我們玩一次"}, {"id": "line-330", "start": 1017.46, "end": 1021.6, "text": "不然真是這隻叫性愛五福臨門"}, {"id": "line-331", "start": 1021.6, "end": 1023.98, "text": "而且又不自主加菜"}, {"id": "line-332", "start": 1023.98, "end": 1026.08, "text": "我們不會收房,麻煩你"}, {"id": "line-333", "start": 1026.56, "end": 1027.0, "text": "好"}, {"id": "line-334", "start": 1038.9, "end": 1040.34, "text": "來吧…"}, {"id": "line-335", "start": 1042.22, "end": 1043.6, "text": "你來得很好"}, {"id": "line-336", "start": 1049.47, "end": 1051.65, "text": "這個故事給你的教訓就是"}, {"id": "line-337", "start": 1051.65, "end": 1053.57, "text": "你不讓我娛樂天"}, {"id": "line-338", "start": 1053.57, "end": 1055.01, "text": "即是不讓你自己"}, {"id": "line-339", "start": 1055.63, "end": 1057.27, "text": "你不讓我娛樂天"}, {"id": "line-340", "start": 1057.27, "end": 1059.19, "text": "含蓄是不讓你自己走"}, {"id": "line-341", "start": 1059.19, "end": 1060.89, "text": "你自處於我娛樂天"}, {"id": "line-342", "start": 1060.89, "end": 1062.87, "text": "就是自處於幸福"}, {"id": "line-343", "start": 1063.97, "end": 1069.65, "text": "有這個時候,各位觀眾"}, {"id": "line-344", "start": 1070.51, "end": 1071.87, "text": "應該是怎樣反應"}, {"id": "line-345", "start": 1071.87, "end": 1072.79, "text": "真聰明"}, {"id": "line-346", "start": 1074.84, "end": 1078.3, "text": "開心發掌,歡呼發掌"}, {"id": "line-347", "start": 1078.3, "end": 1081.46, "text": "讓你知道我的厲害"}, {"id": "line-348", "start": 1081.46, "end": 1084.38, "text": "開心發掌"}, {"id": "line-349", "start": 1084.38, "end": 1088.16, "text": "你想怎樣"}, {"id": "line-350", "start": 1088.16, "end": 1098.99, "text": "不,抱不抱"}]}